WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.596 --> 00:00:02.864
OFFICIAL WOULD WANT TO FOCUS ON

00:00:02.865 --> 00:00:04.633
THE ACTUAL THREATS.

00:00:04.634 --> 00:00:06.902
&gt;&gt; JOINING ME NOW, BRANDON JUDD.

00:00:06.903 --> 00:00:09.604
HE'S THE PRESIDENT OF THE

00:00:09.605 --> 00:00:13.241
NATIONAL BORDER PATROL UNION,

00:00:13.242 --> 00:00:18.847
MARK KERKORIAN AND SEMAN NESARY.

00:00:18.848 --> 00:00:20.716
BRANDON, I WANT TO START WITH

00:00:20.717 --> 00:00:21.416
YOU.

00:00:21.417 --> 00:00:24.720
YOU WERE PART OF THE WHITE HOUSE

00:00:24.721 --> 00:00:26.988
MEETING THAT ENDED WITH

00:00:26.989 --> 00:00:28.890
INFORMATION ALONG THE BORDER.

00:00:28.891 --> 00:00:33.128
IS THIS AN INVENTED THREAT THAT

00:00:33.129 --> 00:00:35.163
MANY IN THE MEDIA ARE SAYING?

00:00:35.164 --> 00:00:36.331
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY NOT.

00:00:36.332 --> 00:00:39.334
LOOK AT THE NUMBER OF PEOPLE

00:00:39.335 --> 00:00:40.635
GATHERING IN TIJUANA THAT ARE

00:00:40.636 --> 00:00:42.170
WAITING TO COME ACROSS THE

00:00:42.171 --> 00:00:42.504
BORDER.

00:00:42.505 --> 00:00:44.072
THE THREATS THAT THEY'RE GOING

00:00:44.073 --> 00:00:46.308
TO STORM THE PORTS OF ENTRY,

00:00:46.309 --> 00:00:48.176
IT'S A SIGN THAT THEY DON'T CARE

00:00:48.177 --> 00:00:50.445
ABOUT OUR LAWS, THEY'RE GOING TO

00:00:50.446 --> 00:00:52.047
DO WHAT THEY NEED TO DO FOR

00:00:52.048 --> 00:00:53.749
THEIR OWN BENEFIT INSTEAD OF

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:55.617
DOING IT IN A LEGAL MANNER.

00:00:55.618 --> 00:00:57.386
WHEN I WAS IN THAT MEETING, WHAT

00:00:57.387 --> 00:01:01.223
I SAW, I SAW AN UNWAVERING

00:01:01.224 --> 00:01:02.491
DETERMINATION TO SECURE THE

00:01:02.492 --> 00:01:03.825
BORDER FOR THE AMERICAN PUBLIC,

00:01:03.826 --> 00:01:05.794
FOR THE SAFETY OF THE AMERICAN

00:01:05.795 --> 00:01:06.161
PUBLIC.

00:01:06.162 --> 00:01:09.598
WE APPRECIATE THAT AND

00:01:09.599 --> 00:01:10.565
APPRECIATE THAT DETERMINATION

00:01:10.566 --> 00:01:12.367
THE PRESIDENT HAS.

00:01:12.368 --> 00:01:14.569
&gt;&gt; AND YOUR REACTION, SEMAN.

00:01:14.570 --> 00:01:16.405
THIS IS THE HEAD OF THE BORDER

00:01:16.406 --> 00:01:16.705
UNION.

00:01:16.706 --> 00:01:18.473
HE KNOWS WHAT'S GOING ON THERE.

00:01:18.474 --> 00:01:19.374
YOUR REACTION?

00:01:19.375 --> 00:01:21.410
&gt;&gt; AND I THINK THAT THE

00:01:21.411 --> 00:01:22.210
CONVERSATION SHOULDN'T BE SO

00:01:22.211 --> 00:01:27.649
MUCH ABOUT THE CARAVAN BUT THE

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:29.251
CARAVAN SHEDS LIGHT THAT OUR

00:01:29.252 --> 00:01:30.752
IMMIGRATION SYSTEM IS BROKEN.

00:01:30.753 --> 00:01:32.287
THE FACT THAT THIS IS A REAL

00:01:32.288 --> 00:01:33.488
THREAT IS 5,000 PEOPLE COMING TO

00:01:33.489 --> 00:01:37.058
THE BORDER, SEEKING ASYLUM.

00:01:37.059 --> 00:01:41.129
WHY IS THAT -- WHY ISN'T THE

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:42.631
SYSTEM THE ISSUE?

00:01:42.632 --> 00:01:44.599
THESE PEOPLE HAVE NOT RUSHED THE

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:45.000
BORDER.

00:01:45.001 --> 00:01:46.668
NOBODY HAS SEEN THEM HURT

00:01:46.669 --> 00:01:47.002
ANYBODY.

00:01:47.003 --> 00:01:48.870
SO WHY ARE WE MAKING THE PEOPLE

00:01:48.871 --> 00:01:50.272
ESCAPING THEIR PROBLEMS THE

00:01:50.273 --> 00:01:50.572
ISSUE?

00:01:50.573 --> 00:01:52.007
WHY DON'T WE TRY TO CRITICIZE

00:01:52.008 --> 00:01:53.308
THE IMMIGRATION SYSTEM AND FIX

00:01:53.309 --> 00:01:53.909
THAT PROBLEM?

00:01:53.910 --> 00:01:56.378
&gt;&gt; LET'S HOLD IT THERE A MINUTE,

00:01:56.379 --> 00:01:56.678
SAMAN.

00:01:56.679 --> 00:02:01.149
THERE'S ABUSES OF THE ASYLUM

00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:03.552
SYSTEM GOING ON.

00:02:03.553 --> 00:02:06.054
ASYLUM IS BECAUSE YOU'RE UNDER

00:02:06.055 --> 00:02:06.988
PERSECUTION, NOT JUST BECAUSE

00:02:06.989 --> 00:02:08.256
YOU WANT A GEORGE.

00:02:08.257 --> 00:02:08.557
MARK?

00:02:08.558 --> 00:02:09.157
&gt;&gt; THAT'S RIGHT.

00:02:09.158 --> 00:02:12.060
I'D SAY THAT THE BROADER SYSTEM

00:02:12.061 --> 00:02:12.994
IS THE PROBLEM.

00:02:12.995 --> 00:02:17.232
THE SYSTEM IS WE HAVE ASYLUM

00:02:17.233 --> 00:02:19.067
RULES THAT INCENTIVIZE PEOPLE TO

00:02:19.068 --> 00:02:25.907
MAKE THESE BOGUS ASYLUM CLAIMS

00:02:25.908 --> 00:02:28.410
ESSENTIALLY USE ASYLUM AS A

00:02:28.411 --> 00:02:29.878
STRATEGY FOR IMMIGRATION.

00:02:29.879 --> 00:02:32.180
NONE OF THESE PEOPLE HAVE A

00:02:32.181 --> 00:02:33.148
REALISTIC EXPECTATION OF GETTING

00:02:33.149 --> 00:02:35.016
POLITICAL ASYLUM AT THE END OF

00:02:35.017 --> 00:02:35.517
THE DAY.

00:02:35.518 --> 00:02:37.486
THEY'RE DOING THIS TO APPLY FOR

00:02:37.487 --> 00:02:42.290
ASYLUM AS A WAY OF GETTING

00:02:42.291 --> 00:02:43.892
PASSED THE BORDER AND THEN

00:02:43.893 --> 00:02:44.860
THEY'RE HOME FREE.

00:02:44.861 --> 00:02:46.728
THIS HAS BEEN GOING ON SINCE THE

00:02:46.729 --> 00:02:49.231
OBAMA ADMINISTRATION WHO

00:02:49.232 --> 00:02:50.832
INCENTIVIZED IT AND WE'RE STILL

00:02:50.833 --> 00:02:52.400
DEALING WITH THE FALLOUT FROM

00:02:52.401 --> 00:02:52.667
IT.

00:02:52.668 --> 00:02:54.469
THAT'S WHY WE HAVE THIS CARAVAN

00:02:54.470 --> 00:02:57.772
AND OTHER CARAVANS THAT ARE

00:02:57.773 --> 00:03:00.342
DOING THE SAME THING.

00:03:00.343 --> 00:03:02.577
&gt;&gt; THIS IS KIRSTJEN NIELSEN

00:03:02.578 --> 00:03:03.778
ALONG THE BORDER.

00:03:03.779 --> 00:03:04.112
LISTEN.

00:03:04.113 --> 00:03:06.081
&gt;&gt; THE REALITY IS, THERE'S

00:03:06.082 --> 00:03:08.383
CURRENTLY OVER 6,200 INDIVIDUALS

00:03:08.384 --> 00:03:11.052
CAMPED OUT SOUTH OF THE U.S.

00:03:11.053 --> 00:03:13.588
BORDER IN TIJUANA TODAY AS I

00:03:13.589 --> 00:03:14.189
STAND HERE.

00:03:14.190 --> 00:03:16.825
IN MEXICALI, THERE'S MORE THAN

00:03:16.826 --> 00:03:17.959
3,000 CARAVAN MEMBERS.

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:20.128
THE TWO GROUPS COMBINED WITH

00:03:20.129 --> 00:03:23.064
OTHER CARAVANS MAKING THEIR WAY

00:03:23.065 --> 00:03:24.966
THROUGH MEXICO WILL RESULT IN

00:03:24.967 --> 00:03:27.502
PRESIDENT 8,000 TO 10,000

00:03:27.503 --> 00:03:29.838
MIGRANTS AMASSING ALONG OUR

00:03:29.839 --> 00:03:31.273
SOUTHERN BORDER.

00:03:31.274 --> 00:03:33.108
THE CRISIS IS REAL AND IT'S ON

00:03:33.109 --> 00:03:35.143
THE OTHER SIDE OF THIS WALL.

00:03:35.144 --> 00:03:36.511
&gt;&gt; YOUR REACTION.

00:03:36.512 --> 00:03:38.413
I WANT TO GO TO BRANDON JUDD.

00:03:38.414 --> 00:03:42.050
&gt;&gt; AGAIN, IF YOU LOOK AT THIS,

00:03:42.051 --> 00:03:44.052
THIS IS NOT ABOUT LEGAL

00:03:44.053 --> 00:03:44.452
IMMIGRATION.

00:03:44.453 --> 00:03:46.555
IT'S ABOUT ILLEGAL IMMIGRATION.

00:03:46.556 --> 00:03:48.256
THOSE PEOPLE ARE NOT GOING TO

00:03:48.257 --> 00:03:49.391
WAIT UNTIL THEY GO THROUGH THE

00:03:49.392 --> 00:03:50.425
PORTS OF ENTRY.

00:03:50.426 --> 00:03:52.727
THEY WILL CROSS ILLEGALLY.

00:03:52.728 --> 00:03:54.396
THE FIRST ACT THAT THEY MAKE IN

00:03:54.397 --> 00:03:56.932
THE UNITED STATES IS AN ILLEGAL

00:03:56.933 --> 00:03:57.198
ACT.

00:03:57.199 --> 00:03:59.134
THAT SHOULD MAKE EVERYBODY A

00:03:59.135 --> 00:04:01.336
LITTLE BIT CONCERNED ABOUT WHAT

00:04:01.337 --> 00:04:03.838
IS MOTIVES ARE.

00:04:03.839 --> 00:04:05.273
&gt;&gt; WHAT ABOUT THE CRIMINAL

00:04:05.274 --> 00:04:07.108
ELEMENT HERE?

00:04:07.109 --> 00:04:09.244
THEY CLAIM THEY HAVE 500

00:04:09.245 --> 00:04:12.447
CRIMINALS AS PART OF THESE

00:04:12.448 --> 00:04:15.317
CARAVANS.

00:04:15.318 --> 00:04:16.651
SAMAN, DOES THAT SAY TO YOU TO

00:04:16.652 --> 00:04:19.154
LET THEM IN UNDER THE ASYLUM

00:04:19.155 --> 00:04:19.421
LAW?

00:04:19.422 --> 00:04:20.589
&gt;&gt; THAT'S THE WRONG

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:21.222
CHARACTERIZATION OF THE

00:04:21.223 --> 00:04:21.590
ARGUMENT.

00:04:21.591 --> 00:04:23.058
THESE --

00:04:23.059 --> 00:04:25.360
&gt;&gt; IT'S NOT A CHARACTERIZATION.

00:04:25.361 --> 00:04:26.795
&gt;&gt; IT IS.

00:04:26.796 --> 00:04:29.497
&gt;&gt; NO, IT'S WHAT HOMELAND --

00:04:29.498 --> 00:04:31.733
THIS IS WHAT --

00:04:31.734 --> 00:04:34.603
&gt;&gt; THERE'S NO EVIDENCE OF THAT.

00:04:34.604 --> 00:04:36.237
&gt;&gt; SO KIRSTJEN NIELSEN IS LIE

00:04:36.238 --> 00:04:36.638
SOMETHING.

00:04:36.639 --> 00:04:36.972
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:04:36.973 --> 00:04:39.140
THEY ISSUED A MEMO SAYING WE

00:04:39.141 --> 00:04:40.675
NEED TO WORK WITH MEXICO TO VET

00:04:40.676 --> 00:04:42.377
THESE PEOPLE, KEEP THEM IN

00:04:42.378 --> 00:04:44.312
MEXICO, GO THROUGH THE ASYLUM

00:04:44.313 --> 00:04:47.415
PROCESS THERE AND TAKE IT ON A

00:04:47.416 --> 00:04:50.685
CASE BY CASE BASIS AND SO WHO

00:04:50.686 --> 00:04:51.052
QUALIFIES.

00:04:51.053 --> 00:04:52.253
THERE'S NO EVIDENCE OR NO PROOF

00:04:52.254 --> 00:04:54.189
THAT THESE GUYS WILL SHOW UP TO

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:59.461
THE PORT OF ENTRY AND BUM RUSH

00:04:59.462 --> 00:05:01.663
IT AND BECOMING ILLEGAL

00:05:01.664 --> 00:05:02.063
IMMIGRANTS.

00:05:02.064 --> 00:05:04.432
THEY'RE COMING TO SEEK ASYLUM.

00:05:04.433 --> 00:05:07.435
SOME OF THEM REALLY DO HAVE A

00:05:07.436 --> 00:05:09.070
VERY PLAUSIBLE CASE.

00:05:09.071 --> 00:05:10.271
UNFORTUNATELY THEY GET WASHED UP

00:05:10.272 --> 00:05:11.640
WITH THE ONES BECAUSE THEY WANT

00:05:11.641 --> 00:05:12.574
A BETTER JOB.

00:05:12.575 --> 00:05:14.809
THE TRUTH IS, THERE'S A HANDFUL,

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:15.944
A FEW HUNDRED OF THEM THAT HAVE

00:05:15.945 --> 00:05:18.179
A GOOD CASE THAT ARE LIVING IN

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:19.581
BAD CONDITIONS THAT HAVE SEEN

00:05:19.582 --> 00:05:22.884
PEOPLE GET MURDERED, THAT HAVE

00:05:22.885 --> 00:05:24.119
HAD FAMILY MEMBERS GETS

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:24.486
MURDERED.

00:05:24.487 --> 00:05:26.221
I TURN AWAY A DOZEN PEOPLE THAT

00:05:26.222 --> 00:05:27.856
SAY I CAN'T HELP YOU.

00:05:27.857 --> 00:05:29.858
BUT EVERY ONCE IN A WHILE

00:05:29.859 --> 00:05:31.426
SOMEBODY DOES HAVE A GOOD CASE.

00:05:31.427 --> 00:05:34.095
&gt;&gt; THERE'S NO DOUBT THE ASYLUM

00:05:34.096 --> 00:05:37.332
LAWS NEED TO BE RE-VISITED.

00:05:37.333 --> 00:05:39.934
WE CAN'T -- MY FATHER WAITED A

00:05:39.935 --> 00:05:42.137
YEAR IN LINE BEFORE HE HAD HIS

00:05:42.138 --> 00:05:43.204
PAPERS RECOGNIZED.

00:05:43.205 --> 00:05:45.073
THEN HE CAME WITH A SPONSOR AND

00:05:45.074 --> 00:05:47.676
THEN SERVED IN THE MILITARY.

00:05:47.677 --> 00:05:49.644
THANK YOU, GENTLEMEN, FOR YOUR

00:05:49.645 --> 00:05:50.178
CONTRIBUTION.

00:05:50.179 --> 00:05:52.547
HERE NOW TO EXPLORE WHETHER THE

00:05:52.548 --> 00:05:53.515
PRESIDENT HAS THE CONSTITUTIONAL

00:05:53.516 --> 00:05:56.718
AUTHORITY TO USE U.S. TROOPS TO

00:05:56.719 --> 00:05:57.919
PROTECT THE BORDER AND ON

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:00.588
AMERICAN SOIL, THE BORDER

00:06:00.589 --> 00:06:02.857
AGENTS, WE'RE JOINED BY DONALD

00:06:02.858 --> 00:06:03.191
CRAMER.

00:06:03.192 --> 00:06:05.226
A FORMER INTELLIGENCE OFFICER

00:06:05.227 --> 00:06:09.197
AND IRAQ VETERAN, JOEL RUBEN,

00:06:09.198 --> 00:06:12.000
FORMER OBAMA SECRETARY OF STATE.

00:06:12.001 --> 00:06:13.268
JOEL,YOU BELIEVE THE PRESIDENT

00:06:13.269 --> 00:06:14.602
WAS WRONG BECAUSE OF THE UNCLEAR

00:06:14.603 --> 00:06:15.070
MISSION.

00:06:15.071 --> 00:06:17.972
BUT ISN'T PROTECTING THE

00:06:17.973 --> 00:06:19.541
SOUTHERN BORDER AND ENFORCING

00:06:19.542 --> 00:06:21.176
STANDING IMMIGRATION LAWS

00:06:21.177 --> 00:06:22.343
MISSION ENOUGH?

00:06:22.344 --> 00:06:24.045
&gt;&gt; WELL, RAY, THERE'S NO

00:06:24.046 --> 00:06:24.646
MISSION.

00:06:24.647 --> 00:06:40.095
THERE'S NO MILITARY MISSION

00:06:40.096 --> 00:06:40.395
HERE.

00:06:40.396 --> 00:06:41.129
THERE'S NO CLARITY ABOUT THE END

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:41.863
POINT, WHAT THE OBJECTIVES WILL

00:06:41.864 --> 00:06:42.130
BE.

00:06:42.131 --> 00:06:42.598
EVEN IF THERE'S A TECHNICAL

00:06:52.441 --> 00:06:53.208
ABILITY OF THE PRESIDENT TO SEND

00:06:53.209 --> 00:06:53.908
THE TROOPS THERE, IT'S A BAD

00:06:53.909 --> 00:06:54.275
JUDGMENT.

00:06:54.276 --> 00:06:55.009
THIS PRESIDENT HAS A HABIT OF

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:59.814
USING OUR TROOPS AS POLITICAL

00:06:59.815 --> 00:07:00.548
PROBLEMS AND THAT WAS THE INTENT

00:07:00.549 --> 00:07:01.282
FOR THIS PRIOR TO THE MID-TERMS

00:07:01.283 --> 00:07:01.850
TO TURN OUT THE VOTE.

00:07:01.851 --> 00:07:02.550
THE TROOPS ARE DOING NOTHING,

00:07:02.551 --> 00:07:02.884
WAITING.

00:07:02.885 --> 00:07:03.351
DOING SUPPORT.

00:07:03.352 --> 00:07:08.123
WE HAVE CIVILIAN ENFORCEMENT

00:07:08.124 --> 00:07:11.893
THAT CAN DO THE JOB.

00:07:11.894 --> 00:07:14.696
WE DON'T NEED OUR TROOPS THERE.

00:07:14.697 --> 00:07:15.697
&gt;&gt;

00:08:05.247 --> 00:08:06.181
&gt;&gt; Laura:

00:08:06.182 --> 00:08:15.690
&gt;&gt; DOES THE PRESIDENT HAVE THE

00:08:15.691 --> 00:08:17.459
AUTHORITY HERE?

00:08:17.593 --> 00:08:19.427
&gt;&gt; THESE SOLDIERS AND SOURCES,

00:08:19.428 --> 00:08:20.829
THEY'RE NOT LAW ENFORCEMENT

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:21.196
OFFICIALS.

00:08:21.197 --> 00:08:23.898
HE DOES HAVE THE RIGHT TO DEPLOY

00:08:23.899 --> 00:08:24.199
THEM.

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:25.633
IT'S HIS RIGHT AS

00:08:25.634 --> 00:08:27.535
COMMANDER-IN-CHIEF TO SUPPORT

00:08:27.536 --> 00:08:32.841
THIS COUNTRY, WHETHER IT'S IN

00:08:32.842 --> 00:08:34.642
HUMANITARIAN AID OR SUPPORTING

00:08:34.643 --> 00:08:36.277
THE BORDERS.

00:08:36.278 --> 00:08:38.947
PRESIDENT DID IT, PRESIDENT

00:08:38.948 --> 00:08:40.849
REAGAN DID IT, PRESIDENT BUSH

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:41.282
DID IT.

00:08:41.283 --> 00:08:43.518
IT'S HIS RIGHT AND HE HAS TO

00:08:43.519 --> 00:08:44.352
PROTECT THIS COUNTRY.

00:08:44.353 --> 00:08:45.887
&gt;&gt; JOEL, YOUR REACTION.

00:08:45.888 --> 00:08:48.122
&gt;&gt; I BELIEVE THAT WE COULD FIND

00:08:48.123 --> 00:08:52.594
THE $100 MILLION ON SPENDING THE

00:08:52.595 --> 00:08:56.464
TROOPS TO SEND IT TO THE

00:08:56.465 --> 00:08:57.999
COUNTRIES THE HELP STABILIZE

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:58.299
THEM.

00:08:58.300 --> 00:08:59.534
&gt;&gt; Neil: YOU DON'T BELIEVE

00:08:59.535 --> 00:09:00.401
THERE'S A NATIONAL --

00:09:00.402 --> 00:09:02.537
&gt;&gt; I BELIEVE OUR AGENTS FROM DHS

00:09:02.538 --> 00:09:04.706
ARE CAPABLE OF HANDING THIS.

00:09:04.707 --> 00:09:07.675
WE DON'T NEED TROOPS AT THE

00:09:07.676 --> 00:09:10.912
BORDER NOW BEING AUTHORIZED TO

00:09:10.913 --> 00:09:15.283
SHOOT AT A CARAVAN.

00:09:15.284 --> 00:09:17.218
MAJORITY OF THEM ARE WOMEN AND

00:09:17.219 --> 00:09:18.653
CHILDREN IN CAMPS.

00:09:18.654 --> 00:09:20.421
&gt;&gt; IT'S NOT ALL WOMEN AND

00:09:20.422 --> 00:09:20.855
CHILDREN --

00:09:20.856 --> 00:09:23.224
&gt;&gt; THE MAJORITY ARE.

00:09:23.225 --> 00:09:24.893
&gt;&gt; YOU HAVE PEOPLE WITH WEAPONS.

00:09:24.894 --> 00:09:29.264
THEY'RE BEING ARRESTED BY THE

00:09:29.265 --> 00:09:29.831
TIJUANA GOVERNMENT.

00:09:29.832 --> 00:09:31.499
&gt;&gt; AND THE POLICE CAN HANDER

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:31.799
THAT.

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:33.101
AN ORDERLY PROCESS.

00:09:33.102 --> 00:09:35.136
A PROCESS IN PLACE IS WORKING

00:09:35.137 --> 00:09:35.703
AND SHOULD WORK.

00:09:35.704 --> 00:09:37.238
WE DON'T NEED MILITARY TROOPS

00:09:37.239 --> 00:09:38.773
THERE TO ENFORCE THE PROCESS

00:09:38.774 --> 00:09:41.242
THAT IS ALREADY BEING EXECUTED

00:09:41.243 --> 00:09:41.609
PROPERLY.

00:09:41.610 --> 00:09:43.177
&gt;&gt; DONALD, YOUR THOUGHTS?

00:09:43.178 --> 00:09:45.780
DO WE NEED THE TROOPS OR NOT?

00:09:45.781 --> 00:09:47.715
OR IS TRUMP PLAYING FAST AND

00:09:47.716 --> 00:09:48.516
LOOSE HERE?

00:09:48.517 --> 00:09:54.956
&gt;&gt; NO, WE NEED THE TROOPS.

00:09:54.957 --> 00:09:57.558
CBP IS 80% UNDERMANNED.

00:09:57.559 --> 00:09:59.027
IF THE TROOPS CAN SUPPORT THEM

00:09:59.028 --> 00:10:00.895
SO THE OFFICERS CAN DO THEIR

00:10:00.896 --> 00:10:01.629
JOB, IT'S IMPORTANT.

00:10:01.630 --> 00:10:03.531
IF THEY'RE OBSERVING AND

00:10:03.532 --> 00:10:05.233
PROVIDING SUPPORT, LET THEM DO

00:10:05.234 --> 00:10:06.734
THEIR JOBS SO THEY CAN DO WHAT

00:10:06.735 --> 00:10:07.568
THEY'RE HIRED TO DO.

00:10:07.569 --> 00:10:10.071
&gt;&gt; I'LL GIVE YOU A SHOT AT THIS.

00:10:10.072 --> 00:10:11.673
SHOULD THE PRESIDENT CLOSE THE

00:10:11.674 --> 00:10:12.106
BORDER DOWN?

00:10:12.107 --> 00:10:14.008
DOES HE HAVE THE AUTHORITY TO DO

00:10:14.009 --> 00:10:14.442
SO?

00:10:14.443 --> 00:10:15.677
DONALD AND JOEL.

00:10:15.678 --> 00:10:16.678
10 SECOND EACH.

00:10:16.679 --> 00:10:17.779
&gt;&gt; WHETHER OR NOT HE SHOULD OR

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:19.480
SHOULD NOT, THAT REMAINS A

00:10:19.481 --> 00:10:22.684
QUESTION AS WE LOOK FORWARD TO

00:10:22.685 --> 00:10:23.117
THE CARAVAN.

00:10:23.118 --> 00:10:25.086
DOES HE HAVE THE AUTHORITY?

00:10:25.087 --> 00:10:25.486
ABSOLUTELY.

00:10:25.487 --> 00:10:27.355
IT'S HIS RIGHT TO DEFEND OUR

00:10:27.356 --> 00:10:28.823
BORDERS AND PROTECT THE UNITED

00:10:28.824 --> 00:10:29.324
STATES CITIZENS.

00:10:29.325 --> 00:10:31.025
&gt;&gt; JOEL, IF HE BELIEVES THERE'S

00:10:31.026 --> 00:10:32.827
A NATIONAL SECURITY THREAT,

00:10:32.828 --> 00:10:34.963
CLEARLY HE CAN CLOSE DOWN THE

00:10:34.964 --> 00:10:35.296
BORDER.

00:10:35.297 --> 00:10:36.631
&gt;&gt; NATIONAL SECURITY THREAT

00:10:36.632 --> 00:10:38.366
SHOULD BE DEALT WITH BUT IT'S AN

00:10:38.367 --> 00:10:45.174
AMERICAN VALUE TO ALLOW PEOPLE

